  DisplayName: Gossip
  IconPath: systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/background.svg
  Description: Everyone has a nosy auntie, a talkative uncle, or a gossiping relative.
    Just like them, you don't mind the chatter from the eternal grapevine. Whether
    you seek out gossip or just happen to be at the right place at the right time,
    you heard rumors of greater exploits away from the comforts of home. Word gets
    by, and so should you, so why not give adventuring a try? Choose two attribute
    boosts. One must be to Charisma or Intelligence , and one is a free attribute
    boost. You're trained in Diplomacy and a Lore skill of your choice. You gain
    the Hobnobber skill feat.
